@startuml
title C4 code - Repository intelligence - session consumption tracing
package "Host session" {
  class "Tool and session hooks" as Hooks <<host events>>
  class "record-session-trace" as Record <<command>>
}

package "Prism MCP server" {
  class "CodexTranscriptClassifier" as Classify <<module>>
  class "TraceBehaviorRegistry" as Behavior <<versioned contract>>
  class "SessionTraceValidator" as Validate <<module>>
  class "SessionTraceStore" as Store <<module>>
  class "summarizeSessionConsumption" as Summarize <<function>>
  class "mcp.callRepositoryTool" as Mcp <<existing function>>
}

Hooks --> Record : provides supported event metadata
Record --> Classify : proves root or subagent execution
Classify --> Record : returns allowlisted session metadata only
Record --> Behavior : resolves exact lifecycle and response shape
Record --> Validate : creates content-free canonical events
Record --> Store : appends bounded idempotent events
Store --> Store : orders events and derives first edit
Store --> Store : fences cleanup and atomic commit with token ownership
Store --> Store : removes expired traces and owned stale temporary files
Mcp --> Summarize : supplies correlation key and canonical root
Summarize --> Store : reads isolated session events
Summarize --> Summarize : uses occurrence order and deduplicates ranges

note right of Validate
  Condition: an event is malformed, oversized, or contains unknown fields.
  Response: reject the event without blocking the host action.
  Governing requirement: session-consumption-tracing.md section 4.
end note

note right of Classify
  Condition: execution is a subagent or root classification is uncertain.
  Response: exclude action details and append a root coverage gap when stable root identity is known.
  Governing requirement: session-consumption-tracing.md section 5.
end note

note right of Behavior
  Condition: a Codex version or provider has no exact reviewed profile.
  Response: keep mutation success unproved and mark missing observations partial.
  Governing requirement: session-consumption-tracing.md section 9.
end note

note right of Store
  Condition: storage authority or lock ownership cannot be proved.
  Response: reject the operation without following links or acknowledging an append.
  Governing requirement: session-consumption-tracing.md section 11.
end note

note right of Summarize
  Condition: the host cannot observe every read or mutation path.
  Response: report partial or unavailable coverage instead of exact zero.
  Governing requirement: session-consumption-tracing.md section 3.
end note
@enduml
